{"pageProps":{"data":{"contentHtml":"<h4 id=\"bloonstd6-mod-helper\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#bloonstd6-mod-helper\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a href=\"README\" title=\"README\">BloonsTD6 Mod Helper</a></h4>\n<h3 id=\"btd_mod_helperapitowers\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#btd_mod_helperapitowers\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a><a href=\"README#BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.Towers\" title=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.Towers\">BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.Towers</a></h3>\n<h2 id=\"modtowersavedata-class\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#modtowersavedata-class\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>ModTowerSaveData Class</h2>\n<p>Mod Content class to easily save and load data that should persist between sessions. All saved data are strings.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-csharp\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">abstract</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">ModTowerSaveData</span> : <span class=\"hljs-title\">BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModContent</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>Inheritance <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/System.Object\" title=\"System.Object\">System.Object</a>  <a href=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModContent\" title=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.ModContent\">ModContent</a>  ModTowerSaveData</p>\n<p>Derived<br>\n↳ <a href=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.Towers.ModTowerSaveData_T_\" title=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.Towers.ModTowerSaveData<T>\">ModTowerSaveData&#x3C;T></a></p>\n<h3 id=\"properties\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#properties\"><span class=\"icon icon-link\"></span></a>Properties</h3>\n<p><a name=\"BTD_Mod_Helper.Api.Towers.ModTowerSaveData.TowerBaseId\"></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"modtowersavedatatowerbaseid-property\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"position-relative\" href=\"#modto